# No test files

This project does not use an automated test suite. Do not create test files.

- Do **not** add `*.test.ts`, `*.test.tsx`, `*.spec.ts`, `*.spec.tsx`, or `__tests__/` directories
- Do **not** add testing frameworks (Jest, Vitest, Playwright, Cypress, etc.) unless explicitly requested
- Do **not** suggest adding tests as part of routine feature work or code reviews

If the user explicitly asks for tests, follow their instructions for that task only.
